// Williams %R Reversion
//
// Larry Williams' oscillator — the mirror of the stochastic, on a -100..0 scale. Below -80
// is "oversold": the close is near the bottom of its recent range.
//
// Like every reversion rule here it wins often and loses rarely but largely. Read the
// expectancy and the max drawdown, not the win rate.
strategy("Williams %R Reversion", overlay = false)

w = willr(14)

plot(w,   title = "%R", color = color.accent)
plot(-80, title = "Oversold",   color = color.mute, style = style.step)
plot(-20, title = "Overbought", color = color.mute, style = style.step)

if crossover(w, -80)
    strategy.entry("wr", strategy.long)

if crossunder(w, -30)
    strategy.close("wr")
